  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Agricultural Revitalization and Transformation (START) Facility - Phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The main objective of START Phase II is to &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;promote growth and job creation by investing in fully integrated and sustainable agribusiness SMEs that create and retain wealth within Uganda&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;This specific objective will be achieved by working to:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;a.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Strengthen institutional capacity of agribusiness SMEs and FIs to conduct sustainable business and business operations (including digital solutions);&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;b.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Improve technical capacity of agribusiness SMEs to develop bankable green investment proposals acceptable by financial institutions;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;c.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Unlock affordable medium-term finance for agribusiness SMEs in value addition and responsible agro-processing.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
